msgid "This account is suspended."
msgstr "Deze rekening is geschorst."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This account owes money, so it can't be deleted yet."
msgstr "Deze rekening is geld verschuldigd, dus het kan nog niet verwijderd worden."

#, machine
msgid "This account posts about sensitive topics"
msgstr "Deze account post over gevoelige onderwerpen"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This also signs out chat everywhere else, chat apps included, except the chat this browser has used since you signed in here."
msgstr "Dit ontkoppelt ook chat overal anders, chat-apps inbegrepen, behalve de chat die deze browser heeft gebruikt sinds u hier bent ingelogd."

#. %(time)s is a length of time, such as "6 months"
#, machine, python-format
msgid "This author hasn't been active for %(time)s, so isn't counted."
msgstr "Deze auteur is niet actief geweest voor %(time)s, dus wordt niet geteld."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This ban relies on:"
msgstr "Dit verbod is gebaseerd op:"

#, machine
msgid "This bot can't take tips right now."
msgstr "Deze bot kan nu geen tips aannemen."

#, machine
msgid "This bot has not been approved."
msgstr "Deze bot is niet goedgekeurd."

#, machine
